9. Make Sure Tailwind Line Clamp Works
If line-clamp-2 does not work, replace it with normal text, or install the Tailwind plugin.
Simple fix: replace this:
line-clamp-2
with:
overflow-hidden

10. Run Frontend
From your frontend folder:
cd /u01/nix-life-os/frontendnpm run dev
Then open:
http://localhost:5173/projects

11. Important Token Check
Your frontend expects the token in:
localStorage.getItem("token")
So in browser console, add your token:
localStorage.setItem("token", "REDACTED_TOKEN");
Then refresh:
http://localhost:5173/projects

12. Backend API Expected
This frontend expects these APIs from Step 13/14:
GET    /api/v1/projectsGET    /api/v1/projects/{project}/progressPOST   /api/v1/projects/{project}/progress/recalculateGET    /api/v1/projects/{project}/milestonesGET    /api/v1/projects/{project}/status-updatesPATCH  /api/v1/projects/{project}
Minimum required API for this screen to work:
GET /api/v1/projects
and for the button:
POST /api/v1/projects/{project}/progress/recalculate

